== B1 comma inside a quoted entity-tag (RFC 9110 8.8.3 etagc includes 0x2C) ==
B1a current.etag='"a,b"' accepted as a tag?                -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
B1b if_match='"a,b"' (same tag in a list)                  -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
B1c if_none_match='"a,b"'                                  -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
== B2 semicolon and other punctuation inside a tag (legal etagc) ==
B2a current.etag='"a;b=c"'                                 -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
B2b if_match='"a;b=c"'                                     -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
== B3 CONNECT (RFC 9110 13.2 line 6203-6207 MUST ignore) ==
B3a CONNECT im='"z"' mismatch                              -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_match"}
B3b CONNECT inm='"1"' match                                -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
== B4 cache role + POST (RFC 9111 4.3.2 line 881-885 MUST NOT evaluate) ==
B4a cache POST inm='"1"' match                             -> {"decision": "412", "precondition": "if_none_match"}
B4b cache POST im='"z"' mismatch (IM skipped in cache)     -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
== B5 cache role + IMS with no last_modified (RFC 9111 4.3.2 line 904-907 Date fallback) ==
B5a cache GET ims=500 lastmod=null                         -> {"decision": "200", "precondition": null}
== B6 negative epoch = pre-1970 legal IMF-fixdate ==
B6a ims=-2208988800                                        -> REFUSED: if_modified_since is neither null nor a non-negative int
B6b last_modified=-2208988800                              -> REFUSED: last_modified is neither null nor a non-negative int
== B7 obs-text inside a tag (RFC 9110 8.8.3 etagc includes obs-text) ==
B7a current.etag='"a\u0080b"'                              -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
B7b if_match='"a\u0080b"'                                  -> REFUSED: malformed entity-tag
